      <li><strong>Task</strong>: A sequence of steps as commands, binaries, or scripts.</li>
      <li><strong>PipelineRun</strong>: Execution of a pipeline with one or more tasks.</li>
      <li>
      <strong>TaskRun</strong>: Execution of a task with one or more steps.
