      <h3 id="_mapping_of_concepts" class="group scroll-mt-20">Mapping of concepts<a href="#_mapping_of_concepts" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p>The building blocks of Jenkins and OpenShift Pipelines are not equivalent, and a specific comparison does not provide a technically accurate mapping. The following terms and concepts in Jenkins and OpenShift Pipelines correlate in general:</p>
      <p><strong>Jenkins and OpenShift Pipelines - basic comparison</strong></p>
